1. Progressive Download
Video starts playing while the rest is downloading.

Disadvantage:

 Bankwidth Usage --> Full File Download
                    Network Congestion

 Poor User Experience --> Video Buffering

 Wastage Of Resources 

 Wastage of Data


2. HTTP Range Streaming

Client requests only the required part of the video using the HTTP Range header. You can jump to any time without downloading the whole file.

Range Header = Start + end bytes Range






